{
    "_comment": "Milo at the factory entrance of the Underground Garden (after the Factory boss). He asks directly: 'Why do you keep looking?'. The FIRST real choice with a consequence (rude = Milo offended). Seeing him again at the other entrance (tundra) = a fake 'secret'.",
    "partner": "milo",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_garden_factory"
            },
            "goto": "again"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_garden_tundra"
            },
            "goto": "second_side"
        },
        "first"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "first": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_garden_factory"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "..."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "You're here. Of course you're here."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "This is the Garden. Everything that grows down here grew without the sun. Think about that for a second."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "It's huge. Bigger than everything up there put together. People get lost. Some of them like it."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "I'm going to ask you something, and I want a real answer."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Why do you keep looking?",
                    "speed": 0.7
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Because something here is wrong.",
                    "goto": "honest"
                },
                {
                    "text": "I'm just walking around.",
                    "goto": "evasive"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Mind your own business, Milo.",
                    "goto": "rude"
                }
            ]
        },
        "honest": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo:honest"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Wrong."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "Maybe. Maybe it is."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "But wrong things can still be good to live in. Did you ever think of that?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Up there people laugh, and bake bread, and fish. If you pull on the wrong thread..."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Never mind. Go. Look. Just... be careful what you find."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "evasive": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo:evasive"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Walking around. Through two guards. Down a hole. Into the dark."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Sure. Walking around."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "I'm not stupid, you know. I just pretend really well."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "rude": {
            "do": {
                "flag": [
                    "milo:rude",
                    "offended:milo"
                ]
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "surprised",
                    "text": "..."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "Wow. Okay."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "I was nice to you from the very first day. Remember that.",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "speed": 0.7
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Go on, then. It's your business. Clearly."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "second_side": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_garden_factory"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "surprised",
                    "text": "Oh! You came from the other side too?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Wow. You found it. The big secret. The... second entrance."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "That's it?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "laugh",
                    "text": "That's it. Congratulations. It's a tunnel. Very exciting tunnel. Ten out of ten."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "And yes, I was here first. Again. Don't ask."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "again": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Mushrooms glow down here. Nobody planted them. They just decided to."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Sometimes I hear the roots. They creak like old doors."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "You're still looking. I can tell. You've got that face."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "The deeper you go, the quieter it gets. That's not a good sign. Just so you know."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "I'd tell you to go home. But you'd just ask me where home is."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "What is this place, really?",
                    "goto": "place"
                },
                {
                    "text": "How do you always get here first?",
                    "goto": "howfirst"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Where does it end?",
                    "goto": "ending"
                },
                {
                    "text": "I should go.",
                    "goto": "bye"
                }
            ]
        },
        "hub": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "...What else."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "What is this place, really?",
                    "goto": "place"
                },
                {
                    "text": "How do you always get here first?",
                    "goto": "howfirst"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Where does it end?",
                    "goto": "ending"
                },
                {
                    "text": "I should go.",
                    "goto": "bye"
                }
            ]
        },
        "place": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo_garden:place"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "A garden. Things grow. Nobody tends it. It tends itself."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "It got bigger every year. Nobody remembers it being small."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "howfirst": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo_garden:first"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "I walk fast."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "You don't."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "...I walk fast."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "ending": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo_garden:end"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Somewhere deep in here, there's a way up. Not to the surface. Somewhere else."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "A guard sits in front of it. And behind it..."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "scary",
                    "text": "Please don't.",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "speed": 0.6
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Sorry. Forget it. It's a door. Doors are boring."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
